{"seq":1,"slug":"credit-penalty-event-rule","title":"失信扣分事件与规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/penalty-appeal-govern/credit-penalty-event-rule","wordCount":2501,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"失信扣分事件与规则\">失信扣分事件与规则</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>惩戒规则是把「什么行为算失信」写成机器可执行的判定。它必须解决三个层次的问题：<strong>事件从哪里来</strong>（信号采集）、<strong>什么条件下触发扣分</strong>（判定逻辑）、<strong>触发后扣多少、持续多久</strong>（处置力度）。</p>\n<p>三层里最容易做坏的是第二层。原因是经营场景里几乎每个信号都存在合法例外：买家要求延迟发货、承运商爆仓、平台系统故障导致发货单号回传失败。若判定逻辑只看「是否超时」，商家会因为自己无法控制的原因被惩罚，激励失效。因此规则引擎的核心能力不是「判断真假」，而是<strong>归因与免责</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始信号&lt;br/&gt;订单/物流/售后/巡检] --&gt; B[事件抽取]&#10;  B --&gt; C{证据是否充分?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[挂起待补证]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[责任归因]&#10;  E --&gt; F{免责事由?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[免罚并记录]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[规则匹配]&#10;  H --&gt; I[确定处置等级]&#10;  I --&gt; J[扣分 + 设定恢复期]&#10;  J --&gt; K[生成理由说明]&#10;  K --&gt; L[通知商家]&#10;  L --&gt; M[申诉窗口开启]\">graph TD\n  A[原始信号&lt;br/&gt;订单/物流/售后/巡检] --&gt; B[事件抽取]\n  B --&gt; C{证据是否充分?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[挂起待补证]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[责任归因]\n  E --&gt; F{免责事由?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[免罚并记录]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[规则匹配]\n  H --&gt; I[确定处置等级]\n  I --&gt; J[扣分 + 设定恢复期]\n  J --&gt; K[生成理由说明]\n  K --&gt; L[通知商家]\n  L --&gt; M[申诉窗口开启]</pre><p>流程中「生成理由说明」不是可选步骤。欧盟 DSA 要求平台在限制商家账户或处罚其内容时给出理由，并提供内部投诉处理与庭外争议解决渠道（见 <a href=\"https://digital-strategy.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-services-act-package\">Digital Services Act: 平台义务</a>）。这意味着理由说明是<strong>产品需求</strong>而非运营礼貌。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件族</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>归因难度</th>\n<th>建议处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>履约超时</td>\n<td>发货时效、妥投时效</td>\n<td>中（需排除物流责任）</td>\n<td>轻–中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动取消</td>\n<td>商家取消率</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品描述不符</td>\n<td>退货原因码、纠纷判责</td>\n<td>高（需人工或模型判定）</td>\n<td>中–重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品质量</td>\n<td>质量客诉、抽检不合格</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中–重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚假宣传</td>\n<td>文案巡检、买家举报</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侵权/售假</td>\n<td>权利人投诉、抽检</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恶意行为</td>\n<td>刷单、虚假物流、骚扰买家</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"事件模型的工程实现\">事件模型的工程实现</h2><h3 id=\"事件是三段式-事实-归因-处置\">事件是三段式：事实、归因、处置</h3><p>把三者拆成独立字段，是为了让复核（申诉）能精确到「我不同意哪一段」。商家可能承认事实但主张免责（物流责任），或承认归因但主张力度过重。若三者揉成一个「违规结论」，申诉就只能全盘否定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event_id&quot;: 88123,&#10;  &quot;family&quot;: &quot;fulfillment_timeout&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fact&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;o_5512890&quot;,&#10;    &quot;promised_ship_by&quot;: &quot;2026-08-10T23:59:59Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;actual_ship_at&quot;: &quot;2026-08-14T09:20:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;delay_hours&quot;: 81.3,&#10;    &quot;promise_type&quot;: &quot;in_stock&quot;,&#10;    &quot;evidence_uri&quot;: &quot;s3://evidence/88123/logistics.json&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;attribution&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;liable_party&quot;: &quot;merchant&quot;,&#10;    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.94,&#10;    &quot;exemptions_checked&quot;: [&quot;carrier_outage&quot;, &quot;force_majeure&quot;, &quot;platform_incident&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;disposition&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;level&quot;: &quot;moderate&quot;,&#10;    &quot;score_delta&quot;: -12.0,&#10;    &quot;restore_window_days&quot;: 90,&#10;    &quot;tier_impact&quot;: &quot;none&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;appeal&quot;: { &quot;window_days&quot;: 14, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;open&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88123</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"family\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fulfillment_timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"o_5512890\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"promised_ship_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-10T23:59:59Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"actual_ship_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-08-14T09:20:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"delay_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">81.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"promise_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in_stock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"evidence_uri\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"s3://evidence/88123/logistics.json\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"attribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"liable_party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"merchant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.94</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exemptions_checked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier_outage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"force_majeure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"platform_incident\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disposition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"moderate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"score_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-12.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"restore_window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier_impact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"appeal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>exemptions_checked</code> 记录做了哪些免责检查——即使全部未命中，这个列表也是审计证据，说明系统确实检查过而非直接判罚。<code>confidence</code> 让低置信度的自动归因可以走人工复核而不是直接扣分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扣分事件与分数流水分离\">扣分事件与分数流水分离</h3><p>扣分事件是<strong>业务事实</strong>，分数流水是<strong>计算产物</strong>。两者必须分表：规则可以重判（申诉成功），此时事件状态变为 <code>reversed</code>，并生成一条新的反向流水，而不是修改旧的流水。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE credit_penalty_event (&#10;  event_id       BIGSERIAL   PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entity_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  family         TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  detected_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_version   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  liable_party   TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  confidence     NUMERIC(4,3),&#10;  level          TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  score_delta    NUMERIC(6,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  restore_window_days SMALLINT NOT NULL,&#10;  status         TEXT        NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;active&#39;,&#10;  -- active | exempted | reversed | superseded&#10;  evidence_uri   TEXT,&#10;  reason_text    TEXT        NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_penalty_entity_time&#10;  ON credit_penalty_event (entity_id, detected_at DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> credit_penalty_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  family         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  detected_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  liable_party   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score_delta    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  restore_window_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- active | exempted | reversed | superseded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_uri   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_text    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_penalty_entity_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> credit_penalty_event (entity_id, detected_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>status</code> 用 <code>reversed</code> 而不是删除记录，保证了审计可追溯；<code>reason_text</code> 存自然语言说明，直接用于通知与申诉界面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定与免责的规则设计\">判定与免责的规则设计</h2><h3 id=\"归因必须指向可控主体\">归因必须指向可控主体</h3><p>判定逻辑的第一问应当是「这个结果由谁控制」。以妥投超时为例，链条上有商家（备货速度）、平台仓（出库时效）、承运商（运输时效）、买家（不在家导致二次派送）四个环节。只有商家负责的环节才应计入商家信用。</p>\n<p>工程上的做法是<strong>分段计时</strong>：把从下单到签收的总时长切成若干段，每段归属一个责任方，只对商家段计超时。这个做法需要物流轨迹事件的标准化支撑——如果轨迹事件的口径不统一，分段就无从谈起。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>计时边界</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>是否计入商家信用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>备货</td>\n<td>下单 → 出库</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线运输</td>\n<td>出库 → 到达目的分拣</td>\n<td>承运商</td>\n<td>否（计承运商考核）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端派送</td>\n<td>到达分拨 → 签收</td>\n<td>承运商</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次派送</td>\n<td>首次派送失败 → 再次派送</td>\n<td>买家/承运商</td>\n<td>否（需区分原因）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"免责事由要写成显式规则\">免责事由要写成显式规则</h3><p>免责事由不能靠客服个案判断，必须规则化。四类最常见的免责事由：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>承运商事故</strong>：平台侧记录到承运商分拨中心异常（爆仓、罢工、天气红色预警），该窗口内该线路的超时全部免责。</li>\n<li><strong>平台故障</strong>：平台自身的系统事件（发货单号服务不可用、结算系统维护）导致的商家操作失败。</li>\n<li><strong>买家原因</strong>：买家主动要求延迟发货、地址错误、拒收。</li>\n<li><strong>不可抗力</strong>：政策管控、自然灾害、疫情管制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中<strong>平台故障免责</strong>最容易被遗漏却最重要：如果平台的发货接口挂了 6 小时导致一批商家无法上传单号，不加免责会一次性伤害大量正常商家，事后申诉工作量爆炸且商家信任严重受损。因此平台故障应作为<strong>主动免责</strong>处理，即故障发生时自动为受影响商家减免，而不是等商家来申诉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阈值与统计窗口\">阈值与统计窗口</h3><p>规则的阈值必须同时声明<strong>绝对量</strong>和<strong>相对比率</strong>，并且都设。只看绝对量的后果是惩罚大商家（订单多自然违规多）；只看比率的后果是豁免小商家（5 单里 1 单延迟就是 20%，但不代表经营差）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>trigger</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>violation</mtext></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>violation</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{trigger} \\iff \\left(\\frac{n_{\\text{violation}}}{n_{\\text{total}}} \\geq r_{\\min}\\right) \\wedge \\left(n_{\\text{violation}} \\geq n_{\\min}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trigger</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">violation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">violation</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的取值一般在 5–20 之间，作用是过滤统计噪声。这条双重条件让「5 单中 1 单延迟」不触发（比率达标但绝对量不足），也让「10000 单中 150 单延迟」触发（比率与绝对量都达标）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处置力度与升级\">处置力度与升级</h2><h3 id=\"扣分与等级影响是两件事\">扣分与等级影响是两件事</h3><p>扣分作用于分数，等级影响作用于权益。二者应当解耦：一次中等违规扣 12 分可能不足以降档（只是让商家离刀口更近），但连续三次同类违规就应当触发强制降档。这样处置力度可以连续调节而等级不会频繁抖动。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置等级</th>\n<th>典型条件</th>\n<th>扣分力度</th>\n<th>等级影响</th>\n<th>恢复期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提示</td>\n<td>首次轻微，无实际损失</td>\n<td>0（仅记录）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻微</td>\n<td>首次超时且比率略超</td>\n<td>3–8 分</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>30 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>比率显著超，或重复轻微</td>\n<td>8–20 分</td>\n<td>无（记录累积）</td>\n<td>90 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严重</td>\n<td>描述不符判责、质量事故</td>\n<td>20–50 分</td>\n<td>强制降一档</td>\n<td>180 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特别严重</td>\n<td>售假、资质造假、恶意刷单</td>\n<td>50+ 分或清零</td>\n<td>直接降至观察期</td>\n<td>人工复核，不自动恢复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"累犯升级要有冷却期\">累犯升级要有冷却期</h3><p>「连续三次同类违规触发升级」需要明确定义「连续」：是时间连续（90 天内）还是事件连续（无免责事件插入）？推荐用<strong>滑动窗口 + 计数</strong>：任一同族违规在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 天窗口内累计达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次即升级。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>escalate</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>family</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>detected_at</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{escalate} \\iff \\#\\{e : e.\\text{family} = f,\\ e.\\text{detected\\_at} \\geq t - W\\} \\geq k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7184em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">escalate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">family</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">detected_at</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同时要设<strong>降级机制</strong>：窗口滑过后计数自然减少，处置等级回落。没有降级机制的系统会让商家一旦被标记就永久背负重罚，这既不公平也消除改善动机。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 同族违规滚动计数，用于累犯升级判定&#10;SELECT entity_id,&#10;       family,&#10;       count(*)                              AS hits_in_window,&#10;       max(detected_at)                      AS last_hit,&#10;       sum(score_delta)                      AS total_delta&#10;FROM credit_penalty_event&#10;WHERE status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;  AND detected_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY entity_id, family&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt;= 3&#10;ORDER BY hits_in_window DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同族违规滚动计数，用于累犯升级判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       family,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits_in_window,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(detected_at)                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_hit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score_delta)                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> credit_penalty_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> detected_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_id, family</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits_in_window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询使用滚动窗口而非固定周期分桶，避免了「月初两次、月末两次」被分到两个周期而漏判累犯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则的可测试性\">规则的可测试性</h2><h3 id=\"规则要能回放历史\">规则要能回放历史</h3><p>任何规则变更都必须先在历史数据上回放，回答「如果这条规则上个月就生效，会多/少影响多少商家、多少分数」。没有回放能力就上线新规则，等于拿真实商家做实验，且事后无法解释分数突变。</p>\n<p>回放的关键是事件流可重放——这要求事件表保留足够的原始字段（如 <code>fact.delay_hours</code>），而不仅存判定结论。若只存「扣了 12 分」，回放时无法用新阈值重新判定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则版本化与生效时间\">规则版本化与生效时间</h3><p>规则本身是配置资产，需要版本管理，且必须能回答「这个商家在某个时点被扣分，当时生效的是哪一版规则」。这与分数流水的 <code>rule_version</code> 字段是同一个契约。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则变更类型</th>\n<th>是否追溯</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增免责事由</td>\n<td>是（回滚已扣分）</td>\n<td>纠错性质，商家无过错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收紧阈值</td>\n<td>否（仅向后生效）</td>\n<td>不能因新规追溯惩罚旧行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放宽阈值</td>\n<td>是（可选，需公告）</td>\n<td>让已受罚商家受益，需评估预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调整扣分力度</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>保持已生效处置的稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「收紧阈值不追溯」是一条重要的公平原则：商家在行为发生时依据的是当时的规则，事后收紧并追溯等于改变了过去的行为约束。这与刑法不溯及既往的法理一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>惩戒规则要解决三层问题：信号采集、判定逻辑、处置力度；最难的是判定层的<strong>归因与免责</strong>。</li>\n<li>事件模型拆成 <code>fact</code> / <code>attribution</code> / <code>disposition</code> 三段，使申诉能精确到「不同意哪一段」；<code>exemptions_checked</code> 与 <code>confidence</code> 是审计与人工复核的入口。</li>\n<li>扣分事件与分数流水分表存储，申诉反转用 <code>status = reversed</code> 加反向流水，不修改历史。</li>\n<li>归因必须指向<strong>可控主体</strong>，用分段计时把物流链条切段，只对商家段计超时；平台自身故障应<strong>主动免责</strong>而非等申诉。</li>\n<li>触发条件同时设比率与绝对量双重门槛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∧</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\frac{n_v}{n} \\geq r_{\\min}\\right) \\wedge (n_v \\geq n_{\\min})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r